Error [E0127]: This implicit unit conversion would round
  --> implicit_unit_conversion_rejects_rounding_and_overflow_boundaries.jet:7:14
    |
  7 |     value :: 1meter + 1thirdish
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The exact scale or offset cannot be represented as an integer conversion at this boundary
 Fix: Write `Thirdish.from_meter_rounded(expr, .NearestEven, digits: 0)?` or choose another rounding policy
